---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About Us
lede: A passionate and independent game studio.
description: FIRELEG GAME STUDIOS is an independent video game studio dedicated to creating original, immersive and memorable experiences.
permalink: /about/
pillars:
  - icon: gamepad
    title: Our Studio
    text: "{studio} is an independent game studio dedicated to creating original, immersive and memorable experiences."
  - icon: mountains
    title: Our Vision
    text: To build rich and meaningful worlds, tell powerful stories and offer unique gameplay experiences to players around the world.
  - icon: flame
    title: Our Philosophy
    text: Independence, creativity and passion. We craft the games we truly want to play, with care and ambition.
  - icon: compass
    title: Our Ambitions
    text: To explore many genres and settings, starting with {game}, and to grow a body of work that stays entirely our own.
---
<section class="scene-page" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="scene-page__scene" aria-hidden="true">
    {% image "about/banner-hall.webp", "", { widths: [960, 1600, 2240, 2880], sizes: "100vw", eager: true } %}
  </div>

  <div class="scene-page__content">
    <header class="scene-page__head">
      <h1 class="scene-page__title rise" id="about-title">{{ title }}</h1>
      <p class="scene-page__lede rise" style="--rise-delay: 1">{{ lede }}</p>
    </header>

    <ul class="scene-page__list">
      {%- for item in pillars %}
      <li class="scene-item rise" style="--rise-delay: {{ loop.index0 + 2 }}">
        <span class="scene-item__icon">{% set iconName = item.icon %}{% include "partials/icon.njk" %}</span>
        <div>
          <h2>{{ item.title }}</h2>
          <p>{{ item.text | replace("{studio}", site.name) | replace("{game}", site.firstGame.title) }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    <p class="scene-page__actions rise" style="--rise-delay: 6">
      <a class="btn btn--gold" href="/games/">Discover our games {% include "partials/arrow.njk" %}</a>
      <a class="scene-page__link" href="/discord/">Join our Discord</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
